__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
.env
.git/

# Real ingested data - regenerated by the ETL pipeline inside the container,
# never baked into the image.
backend/data/
*.sqlite3

# Astro build output and Node deps - the frontend-deps stage installs its
# own node_modules, and dist must be built fresh inside the image by the
# entrypoint's ingest+build step (using the container's own live data), not
# copied in from whatever a host-side `npm run build` happened to leave
# behind. Without this, a stale/incomplete local dist silently ships to
# production and the entrypoint's `[ -f dist/index.html ] || npm run build`
# check skips rebuilding it (confirmed live 2026-09-27).
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.astro/
